    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the dusty, brass-plated belly of the 'Aetherwind', a derelict steampunk airship suspended high above the clouds. Hissing copper pipes and the distant grinding of massive clockwork gears fill the air with a mechanical symphony. The ship's engines are dead, and the auxiliary steam pressure is dropping fast. Your only way out is to retrieve the master ignition key secured in the core vault by the eccentric Chief Engineer. To do so, you must decipher a complex network of interlocking cogwheel locks, analytical engines, and pressure valves scattered throughout the engine room. Time is running out, and every machine relies on the precise output of another.",
    "narrative_style": "steampunk"
